  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (11)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (11) is a small, thin-flat component positioned
    at the bottom-center-rear of the engine, made of Material.001, which provides
    excellent sealing properties. Its primary function is to prevent oil leaks from
    the oil pan, ensuring the engine remains lubricated and runs smoothly. Notably,
    the gasket's material composition allows it to withstand the constant flow of
    oil and debris, making it a critical component in maintaining engine health.
